      'A divemaster giving a concise pre-dive briefing on a tidy boat deck, guests checking masks and fins, faces generic and unbranded.',
      'A relaxed surface interval on a Red Sea boat with a simple lunch table, hot drinks and the reef horizon beyond, no product labels visible.',
